preview (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;스캔 중 점군 미리보기 A · B — JSON + cloud_path(E-82)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200.0" y="3165.0" width="210.0" height="72.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bridge.out0" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/command · /d2/safety/stop · resume · /d2/task/check_design (서비스 부름)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;ROS 호출&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="902.0" y="2572.0" width="210.0" height="88.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bridge.out1" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/intent (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;음성 문장&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="902.0" y="2670.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bridge.out2" value="&lt;b&gt;MQTT d2/hmi/get_design/req · save_build/req&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;웹에 물음&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="902.0" y="2723.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bridge.out3" value="&lt;b&gt;get_design · save_build 답 (ROS)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;design/4.0 / ok · retry&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=