;fontColor=#4a5666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1632.0" y="2572.0" width="532.0" height="801.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.grp1" value="&lt;b&gt;클래스 TaskPlanner · PickRanker · ScatterFlow — 작업 판단 · 고르기&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4a5666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1632.0" y="3381.0" width="532.0" height="281.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.grp2" value="&lt;b&gt;클래스 DesignChecker · TemplateChecker — 검사 1 ~ 21번 + 변환기 ① (ROS 없음)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4a5666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1632.0" y="3670.0" width="532.0" height="266.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.grp3" value="&lt;b&gt;클래스 RunLogger · BuildSender — 기록 · 결과 보내기&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4a5666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1632.0" y="3944.0" width="532.0" height="91.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.in0" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/command (서비스 받음)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;select_design · start · scan · cancel · [계속] = start — 다리가 부름&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1382.0" y="2572.0" width="210.0" height="71.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.in1" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/command — 정지 잠금 때(W183 #157)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;STOPPED에서 cancel([초기화] — 기록 닫기 → [정리 끝]) · gripper_open([그리퍼 열기]