)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;design_id · run_id · part_ids&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="2720.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out3" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/vision/find_blocks (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;run_id · height_map · area spare → 공급 · 받침 블록 목록 · area assembly + design_id · part_id → 놓은 블록 다시 재기(A4, 기본 꺼짐)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="2788.0" width="210.0" height="114.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out4" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/pick_place (액션)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;목표 1개 — part_id · grasp(+ TILT · TIP · CENTER_FLAT_* · STANDUP_HIGH · STANDUP_SIDE) · open_width_m · obstacles&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="2912.0" width="210.0" height="85.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out5" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/vision/scan_capture · scan_infer (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;자세마다 촬영 · 추론&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3007.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out6" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/safety/stop (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;TIMEOUT 때 먼저 세움 (source task)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3075.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out7" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/state (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;state/2 — 상태 · 알림(공급 · no_match_block · tilted_block · 웹 끊김 · 정지 · stop_pending · 완성)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3142.0" width="210.0" height="85.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out8" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/progress (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;progress/2.0 → 장면 관리 · 다리 → 화면 (빈 진행표 = 장면 비움)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3237.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out9" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/scan_result (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;scan_result/2.0 → 다리 → 화면 비교&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3304.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out10" value="&lt;b&gt;check_design 답&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;check_result/3.0 — 통과 · errors[kind] · 레시피 · 조립 방법 · feasible_order(W201)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3371.0" width="210.0" height="71.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out11" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/save_build (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;build/2 → 다리 → 웹&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3452.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out12" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/scene/attach (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;출발 때 남은 쥔 상자 떼기(part_id 빈 값 · attach false)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3505.0" width="210.0" height="72.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out13" value="&lt;b&gt;(선택) W144 기록 — w144_record&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;기본 끔 · 켜면 VERIFY 통과마다 observe 촬영 + rosbag → ~/d2_data/runs/w144_* ZIP&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3587.0" width="210.0" height="86.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out14" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/gripper/command (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;gripper_open: 0.0865 m · 10 N (정지 잠금 때만, E-98 · #157)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3683.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st0" value="① 명령: 설계 선택(get_design으로 design/4.0) · 출발 · 스캔 · [계속] · 취소. 4초(timeout.command_s) 안에 확정 못 하면 실행 안 함 → TIMEOUT" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2596.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st1" value="② 시작 점검(서버 move_to · check_progress · pick_place · safety/stop · find_blocks가 떠 있음 · 웹 연결 신호 · 정지 노드 신호 + 안 잠김 · 그리퍼 신호 + 빈 손) → 관측 자세 move_to(observe) · (선택) W144 기록 시작" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2646.0" width="520.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st2" value="③ 확인 부탁 check_progress(design_id · run_id · part_ids) → 답을 TaskPlanner에" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2711.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st3" value="④ 공급 = 흩뿌림 + 받침 경유(supply_mode scatter · via_spare — 공급 칸 없앰, E-103 · W188 #152): 출발 때 남은 쥔 상자 떼기(scene/attach) · 홈 → observe_supply → find_blocks(height_map) → 고른 블록을 받침(spare_spots 첫 자리)에 놓음 → observe_spare → find_blocks(area spare)로 재기 → 세운 블록은 TIP 눕히기 · 맞추기(반대 폭으로 집어 받침 가운데에 옮겨 놓고 다시 재기 — 2 mm 넘으면 블록당 2번, #170) → 세움 · 옆세움 레시피면 맞춘 뒤 STANDUP_HIGH · STANDUP_SIDE로 세우고 다시 잼(세우기는 조립 아님, #156 E-110) → 레시피 잡기(레시피 자세로 선 블록은 바로)로 다시 집어 조립 · 팔이 움직인 실패 블록당 3번 · find_blocks 10초 + 다시 2번 · 막히면 WAIT_SUPPLY(no_match_block) → [계속]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2761.0" width="520.0" height="160.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st4" value="⑤ 부품마다 pick_place 결과 → VERIFY(check_progress) → 다음 부품 → 끝나면 DONE. 그리퍼 응답 없음 · 피드백 없음 = ERROR(E-74). A4 놓은 블록 다시 재기 · 다시 집기(챌린지 B — 한석형 · 측정 민범진, 기본 꺼짐 · 측정 고친 뒤 리허설 · 시연에 켬, E-119 ⑧): VERIFY 통과 블록을 find_blocks area assembly(design_id · part_id)로 다시 재서 기록(w144_measure) → 축별 2 mm 이상(반올림 전)이면 잰 자리에서 집어 처음 목표에 다시 놓고 다시 잼(w144_regrasp — 블록당 2번, 다 써도 남으면 남은 오차 기록 · 다음 블록)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2931.0" width="520.0" height="115.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st5" value="⑤-1 A4 못 잰 경우(측정 거절 rejected · 측정 시각이 요청 · 답 사이 밖 · 기울어짐 · 자세 다름)는 다시 집지 않고 사람도 안 부름 — 까닭만 적고 다음 블록(#182, E-119 ⑩ · 9차). 다시 집기 길을 못 풀면(움직이기 전) 사람 확인 WAIT_SUPPLY → [계속]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3056.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st6" value="⑥ 스캔(IDLE · DONE · SCAN_REVIEW에서 — DONE이면 끝난 조립 기록 그대로 새 run_id): robot.yaml scan.poses 5자세(observe · 뒤 왼쪽 · 앞 · 앞 오른쪽 · 옆, W186)마다 move_to → scan_capture → scan_infer → scan_result 방송 → SCAN_REVIEW(저장된 설계 select_design → READY · scan = 다시 · cancel → IDLE). 답이 ok:false면 &#x27;스캔 실패&#x27; · &#x27;다시 스캔하세요&#x27; + 이유 → ERROR(W182)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3136.0" width="520.0" height="100.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st7" value="⑦ 멈춤이면 STOPPED → 다시 시작 → 쥔 블록 확인 → 진행 확인부터(첫 move_to 0.4배 = 0.2 — recover.speed_ratio). 웹 끊김 3초면 지금 부품까지 놓고 WAIT_HMI. 시간 제한(서비스 3 · move_to 45 · pick_place 120초)을 넘으면 safety/stop(source task) 먼저 · 시간 초과 정지 확인 전 ERROR = message_id stop_pending([다시 시작] 끔, E-117) · 잠금 중 cancel([초기화]) · gripper_open([그리퍼 열기]) 받음(W183 — E-98) · 쥔 채면 &#x27;[정지] → [그리퍼 열기] → [다시 시작]&#x27; 안내" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3246.0" width="520.0" height="115.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st8" value="⑧ 관측 ↔ 레시피(part_id = &lt;설계 ID&gt;_&lt;역할&gt;_&lt;그룹 3자리&gt;_&lt;부품 2자리&gt;) → 진행표 progress/2.0(있음 · 없음 · 높이 · 오차) → 방송 · [조립] 출발 · [초기화] → [정리 끝] 때는 빈 진행표(장면 비움 — DONE · 그냥 정지 → 다시 시작 · [취소]는 그대로, E-120)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3405.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st9" value="⑨ 다음 부품 = placements sequence의 첫 미배치(받침 있음) · 설계 좌표 + 조립 원점 → 로봇 좌표(motion_math)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3485.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st10" value="⑩ PickRanker(pick_rank): 덮이지 않은 블록의 잡기 후보(눕힘 · 옆세움 · 섬 · 기울면 TILT)를 손가락 자리 · 높이 지도로 거른 뒤 높은 곳에서 아래로 — 눕힌 블록 → 옆으로 선 · 선 블록 → 큰 옮김(잡을 게 없을 때만), 묶음 안에서 높은 층부터(기울어진 블록은 실제 높이 · 1.5층 아래면 1층) → 같은 높이면 칸 순서(덮은 블록 치우기 → 곧게 → 틀기 → 기울여 집기) · 열림 · 틈 → 맨 앞 후보. 세움 · 옆세움 레시피 블록은 받침에서 세운 뒤 집음(④ — standup_taught 없으면 STAND_NOT_READY → ERROR)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3535.0" width="520.0" height="115.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st11" value="⑪ 검사 1 ~ 20번: 형식 · 파고듦 · 받침 · 안정성(무게중심 여유 7 mm, 쌓는 도중) · 잡기 틈 · 막힌 칸 · 작업영역 · 블록 수 ≤ 54" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3694.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st12" value="⑫ 21번 Template 검사(base_recipe의 template.composition — 구성 형태 · 범위 · 관계) · 스캔 설계(made_by &quot;scan&quot;)는 건너뜀(E-106) → 통과면 변환기 ①(parts → recipe/4.0 + placements/4.0) → 답. 요청 틀림 = REQUEST_INVALID · TEMPLATE_SHAPE · TEMPLATE_RANGE · errors[kind]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3744.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st13" value="⑫-1 로봇 조립 가능 검사(W201 — 한세교 계산 assembly_feasibility · PM 연결, E-121 · 9차, 검사 순서는 잡기 틈 뒤 · 작업영역 앞): R0 층 방향 · R1 받침 순서 · R2 닿는 면 15 mm · R3 안정성 · R5 손가락 자리로 블록을 하나씩 더해 끝까지 지을 순서를 찾음 → 어떤 순서로도 못 지으면 position(&#x27;로봇 조립 불가&#x27;) · AI 순서만 안 되면 ai_fields + 찾은 순서 → AI가 다시 씀 · 답에 새 칸 feasible_order(스캔은 격자 2.5 · 5 mm 맞춤 뒤)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3824.0" width="520.0" height="100.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st14" value="⑬ run_id CSV(log_dir — A4 a4_measure · a4_regrasp 줄 포함) · build/2 요약 → BuildSender가 save_build(다리 → 웹). 못 보내면 pending_builds/에 두고 다시 · 영구 거절(retry false)은 rejected/로" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3968.0" width="520.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c0" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.300;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in0" target="task.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1602.0" y="2607.5"/><mxPoint x="1602.0" y="2608.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.104;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in1" target="task.st7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1610.0" y="2724.0"/><mxPoint x="1610.0" y="3258.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.300;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in2" target="task.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1618.0" y="2840.5"/><mxPoint x="1618.0" y="2608.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#e00000;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.104;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in3" target="task.st7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1626.0" y="2907.5"/><mxPoint x="1626.0" y="3258.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c4" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#111111;stroke