_motion&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#5566b5&quot;&gt;돌리는 곳: 호스트&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5370.0" y="2496.0" width="350.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.col10" value="&lt;b&gt;입력 — 받는 것&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef0f3;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4878.0" y="2546.0" width="210.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.col266" value="&lt;b&gt;처리 — 하는 일(번호 순)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef0f3;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="2546.0" width="330.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.col642" value="&lt;b&gt;출력 — 내보내는 것&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef0f3;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5510.0" y="2546.0" width="210.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.in0" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/pick_place (액션 받음)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;부품 1개 목표 — pick · place 자세(블록 중심) · grasp · open_width_m · obstacles&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4878.0" y="2572.0" width="210.0" height="86.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.in1" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/move_to (서비스 받음)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;robot.yaml &lt;이름&gt;_pose · speed_ratio&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4878.0" y="2668.0" width="210.0" height="72.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.in2" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/safety/state (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;멈춤 → 목표 취소(CANCELED) · 잠긴 동안 거절&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4878.0" y="2750.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.in3" value="&lt;b&gt;/joint_states · robot.yaml · tcp.json&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;관절값 · 좌표 · 그리퍼 값 · 속도 · TCP = 손가락 가운데(E-81) · 세우기 교시 standup_taught&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4878.0" y="2817.0" width="210.0" height="86.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.in4" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/gripper/state (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;폭 · 잡힘&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4878.0" y="2913.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out0" value="&lt;b&gt;move_group (MoveIt2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;경로 계획 · 실행&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5510.0" y="2572.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out1" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/gripper/command (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;폭 · 힘&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5510.0" y="2625.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out2" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/scene/attach (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;붙이기 · 떼기&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5510.0" y="2678.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out3" value="&lt;b&gt;중간 보고 · 결과&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;step · 성공 · 실패 코드&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5510.0" y="2746.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out4" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/path_markers (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;계획한 경로 TCP 선 → RViz(보기 전용, 받는 노드 없음)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5510.0" y="2799.0" width="210.0" height="72.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st0" value="① approach — 집을 블록 위 0.08 m · 흩뿌림이면 주변 블록을 부풀린 장애물로 공중 이동(#126 — 옛 공급 칸 가정 상자는 지움, #176) · 평소 속도 speed_scale 0.5(자유 이동 · 들기 · 빠지기 · 받침에 놓기 같음) · IK KDL 50 ms" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="2572.0" width="330.0" height="85.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st1" value="② grasp — 그리퍼 기본 활짝(0.110 m) → 블록 바로 위에서 잡기 폭 → 내려가 닫기(10 N, 집으러 내려가기만 0.4배 = 0.2) → 폭으로 잡혔는지 확인 · TILT(기울여 집기 3 ~ 45°) · TIP(받침 눕히기) · CENTER_FLAT(받침 맞추기) · STANDUP_HIGH · STANDUP_SIDE(받침 세우기 — standup_taught 교시 동작, 진입 뒤 모두 MoveL)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="2667.0" width="330.0" height="115.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st2" value="③ attach — SceneAttach로 쥔 블록을 팔에 붙임(E-76) · held_quat = 쥔 상자 방향(E-100 — 세우기용)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="2792.0" width="330.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st3" value="④ lift(같은 직선을 평소 속도로) → move(BiTRRT → RRTConnect, 놓인 블록과 여유 20 mm → 10 mm → 안 풀리면 0(실제 크기)으로 마지막 한 번 — 흩뿌린 주변 블록은 여유 0에도 실제 크기로 피함) → place — 조립 자리 하강만 0.4배(받침은 평소) · 위치 제어로 0.001 m 위에서 놓기" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="2857.0" width="330.0" height="100.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st4" value="⑤ detach — 놓은 블록으로 장면에 남김 → retreat(내려간 직선을 평소 속도로 다시 계획, 안 풀리면 되짚기)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="2967.0" width="330.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st5" value="⑥ 결과 — 성공 · 실패 코드(GRASP_FAILED · GRIPPER_NO_RESPONSE · STOPPED …) · 그리퍼 폭 · 걸린 시간" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="3032.0" width="330.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st6" value="⑦ move_to — robot.yaml &lt;이름&gt;_pose(관측 · 공급 관측 · 받침 관측 · 홈 · 스캔 5자세) · 스캔 이동 때 구조물 상자 structure_box_m 피함(W186)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="3097.0" width="330.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st7" value="⑧ 정지 · task 취소면 진행 중 목표 취소 → 서기 궤적 · 잠긴 동안 거절(STOPPED) · 다른 목표 중 BUSY" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5134.0" y="3177.0" width="330.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.c0" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.141;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pick_place.in0" target="pick_place.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="5098.0" y="2615.0"/><mxPoint x="5098.0" y="2584.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.c1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.171;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pick_place.in1" target="pick_place.st6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="5106.0" y="2704.0"/><mxPoint x="5106.0" y="3109.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.c2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#e00000;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.218;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pick_place.in2" target="pick_place.st7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="5114.0" y="2778.5"/><mxPoint x="5114.0" y="3189.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.c3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#a8a8a8;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.141;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pick_place.in3" target="pick_place.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="5122.0" y="2860.0"/><mxPoint x="5122.0" y="2584.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.c4" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#a8a8a8;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.180;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pick_place.in3" target="pick_place.st3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="5122.0" y="2860.0"/><mxPoint x="5122.0" y="2875.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.c5" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.104;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pick_place.in4" target="pick_place.st1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="5098.0" y="2934.5"/><mxPoint x="5098.0" y="2679.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.c6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.0